    "updated_at": "2023-03-16T12:07:28Z",
    "body": "I guess ideally this is done by Fetch, but we don't want to enforce it for all callers of \"resolve an origin\". Perhaps we can make it such that internal callers in Fetch end up bypassing it. (If we do that I should move this issue to the Fetch repository.)",
